---
import ToolLayout from '../../../layouts/ToolLayout.astro';
---
<ToolLayout title="Quotation Builder" category="Business" description="Create a clean quotation with your business details, line items, discount and tax. Print it or use your browser’s Save as PDF option.">
 <form id="quote-form" class="kit-panel">
  <div class="kit-row"><h2>1. Quotation details</h2><button class="kit-btn" type="button" id="quote-example">Try an example</button></div>
  <div class="kit-fields"><div class="kit-field"><label for="quote-business">Your business name</label><input id="quote-business" maxlength="100" required placeholder="Business name"/></div><div class="kit-field"><label for="quote-client">Customer / company name</label><input id="quote-client" maxlength="100" required placeholder="Customer name"/></div></div>
  <div class="kit-fields"><div class="kit-field"><label for="quote-business-details">Your contact details (optional)</label><textarea id="quote-business-details" class="short-area" maxlength="500" placeholder="Address, email or phone"></textarea></div><div class="kit-field"><label for="quote-client-details">Customer details (optional)</label><textarea id="quote-client-details" class="short-area" maxlength="500" placeholder="Address or contact person"></textarea></div></div>
  <div class="quote-meta-fields"><div class="kit-field"><label for="quote-number">Quotation number</label><input id="quote-number" maxlength="50" value="QT-001" required/></div><div class="kit-field"><label for="quote-date">Issue date</label><input id="quote-date" type="date" required/></div><div class="kit-field"><label for="quote-valid">Valid until (optional)</label><input id="quote-valid" type="date"/></div><div class="kit-field"><label for="quote-currency">Currency</label><select id="quote-currency">{['USD','EUR','GBP','CAD','AUD','NZD','CHF','JPY','CNY','HKD','SGD','INR','AED','SAR','QAR','LKR','ZAR','BRL','MXN'].map(c=><option value={c}>{c}</option>)}</select></div></div>
  <h2>2. Line items</h2><div id="quote-items"></div><button class="kit-btn" type="button" id="quote-add">+ Add line item</button><p class="kit-help">Up to 50 items. Quantity allows 3 decimal places; unit price allows 2.</p>
  <div class="kit-fields" style="margin-top:24px"><div class="kit-field"><label for="quote-discount">Discount (%)</label><input id="quote-discount" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" value="0" required/></div><div class="kit-field"><label for="quote-tax">Tax (%)</label><input id="quote-tax" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" value="0" required/></div></div>
  <div class="kit-field"><label for="quote-notes">Notes / terms (optional)</label><textarea id="quote-notes" maxlength="2000" class="short-area" placeholder="Scope, delivery time, payment terms or exclusions"></textarea></div>
  <p class="kit-help">Tax is applied after the discount. Enter the rate appropriate for your quotation; this tool does not determine tax obligations or produce a tax invoice.</p>
  <div class="kit-actions"><button class="kit-btn primary" type="submit">Preview quotation →</button><button class="kit-btn" id="quote-clear" type="button">Clear all</button></div><p class="kit-status kit-error" role="alert" id="quote-error"></p>
 </form>
 <p class="kit-note">✓ Details stay in this browser. No account, upload or automatic saving. Keep a PDF copy before closing the page.</p>
 <section id="quote-preview-section" hidden aria-labelledby="quote-preview-title" style="margin-top:32px"><div class="kit-row" style="margin-bottom:20px"><h2 id="quote-preview-title">Your quotation</h2><button id="quote-print" class="kit-btn primary" type="button">Print / Save as PDF</button></div><p class="kit-help" role="status" id="quote-status" style="margin-bottom:16px"></p><div id="quote-preview" class="quote-paper"></div></section>
 <section class="kit-guide" id="guide"><h2>A clear quote is easier to review.</h2><div class="kit-guide-grid"><div><h3>Describe the deliverable</h3><p>Use a meaningful item description, quantity and unit price. Put delivery times, exclusions and payment terms in the notes.</p></div><div><h3>Check the totals</h3><p>Each line rounds to two decimals. The discount applies to the subtotal; tax applies to the discounted amount. No currency conversion is performed.</p></div><div><h3>Save a PDF</h3><p>Preview the document, then choose Print / Save as PDF. In your browser’s print dialog, choose Save as PDF, A4 paper and turn off headers and footers for a clean document.</p></div></div><details><summary>Can I use this as an invoice?</summary><p>This document is a quotation, not a tax invoice or proof of payment. Check your local business requirements before using it. Quotation numbers are entered by you and are not automatically tracked across visits.</p></details><details><summary>Will my quotation be saved here?</summary><p>No. The tool does not store your customer details or quotation history. Save a PDF before leaving. Refreshing or closing the page can clear your inputs.</p></details><details><summary>Need help deciding a selling price?</summary><p>Use the <a href="/tools/margin-calculator/">Margin &amp; Markup Calculator</a> to understand your price before entering line items.</p></details></section>
 <template id="quote-item-template"><div class="quote-item"><div><label class="item-description-label">Description<input data-field="description" maxlength="300" required placeholder="Item or service"/></label></div><div><label>Quantity<input data-field="quantity" type="number" min="0.001" max="1000000" step="0.001" value="1" required/></label></div><div><label>Unit price<input data-field="rate" type="number" min="0" max="1000000000" step="0.01" placeholder="0.00" required/></label></div><button type="button" class="kit-btn quote-remove">Remove</button></div></template>
</ToolLayout>
<script>
import {calculateQuote} from '../../../utils/business-tools.mjs';
const get=<T extends HTMLElement>(id:string)=>document.getElementById(id) as T;
const form=get<HTMLFormElement>('quote-form'),items=get('quote-items'),preview=get('quote-preview'),section=get('quote-preview-section');
const field=(name:string)=>(get<HTMLInputElement|HTMLTextAreaElement|HTMLSelectElement>(`quote-${name}`)).value.trim();
const set=(name:string,value:string)=>{get<HTMLInputElement|HTMLTextAreaElement|HTMLSelectElement>(`quote-${name}`).value=value;};
function invalidate(){section.hidden=true;preview.replaceChildren();get('quote-error').textContent='';}
function refreshItems(){const rows=[...items.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.quote-item')];rows.forEach((row,i)=>{const button=row.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.quote-remove')!;button.disabled=rows.length===1;button.setAttribute('aria-label',`Remove line item ${i+1}`);row.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input').forEach(input=>{input.setAttribute('aria-label',`Line ${i+1} ${input.dataset.field==='rate'?'unit price':input.dataset.field}`);});});get<HTMLButtonElement>('quote-add').disabled=rows.length>=50;}
function addItem(description='',quantity='1',rate=''){if(items.children.length>=50)return;const fragment=get<HTMLTemplateElement>('quote-item-template').content.cloneNode(true) as DocumentFragment;const row=fragment.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.quote-item')!;row.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-field=description]')!.value=description;row.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-field=quantity]')!.value=quantity;row.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-field=rate]')!.value=rate;row.querySelector('.quote-remove')!.addEventListener('click',()=>{row.remove();refreshItems();invalidate();});items.append(fragment);refreshItems();}
function localDate(){const d=new Date();return `${d.getFullYear()}-${String(d.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0')}-${String(d.getDate()).padStart(2,'0')}`;}
set('date',localDate());addItem();
form.addEventListener('input',invalidate);
get('quote-add').addEventListener('click',()=>{addItem();invalidate();items.lastElementChild?.querySelector('input')?.focus();});
get('quote-clear').addEventListener('click',()=>{form.reset();set('date',localDate());items.replaceChildren();addItem();invalidate();get('quote-business').focus();});
get('quote-example').addEventListener('click',()=>{set('business','Example Studio');set('client','Sample Customer');set('business-details','hello@example.com');set('client-details','Sample details — replace before sending');set('number','QT-001');set('date',localDate());set('valid','');set('discount','5');set('tax','0');set('notes','Example only. Confirm scope, delivery and payment terms before sending.');items.replaceChildren();addItem('Product photography — edited images','10','25');addItem('Setup and preparation','1','50');invalidate();form.requestSubmit();});
// Build user-supplied content with textContent, never HTML interpolation.
const el=(tag:string,text='',className='')=>{const node=document.createElement(tag);node.textContent=text;if(className)node.className=className;return node;};
form.addEventListener('submit',event=>{event.preventDefault();invalidate();try{
 if(!field('business')||!field('client')||!field('number'))throw new Error('Enter a business name, customer name and quotation number.');
 const date=field('date'),valid=field('valid');if(!date)throw new Error('Choose an issue date.');if(valid&&valid<date)throw new Error('The validity date must be on or after the issue date.');
 const rows=[...items.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.quote-item')].map(row=>{const input=(name:string)=>row.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>(`[data-field=${name}]`)!.value.trim();return {description:input('description'),quantity:input('quantity'),rate:input('rate')};});
 if(rows.some(row=>!row.description))throw new Error('Add a description to every line item.');
 const result=calculateQuote(rows,field('discount'),field('tax'));const money=(cents:number)=>`${field('currency')} ${(cents/100).toLocaleString('en-US',{minimumFractionDigits:2,maximumFractionDigits:2})}`;
 const head=el('div','','quote-doc-head');const brand=el('div');brand.append(el('h2',field('business')),el('p',field('business-details'),'quote-multiline'));const title=el('div');title.append(el('h2','QUOTATION'),el('p',field('number')));head.append(brand,title);preview.append(head);
 const meta=el('div','','quote-doc-meta');const client=el('div');client.append(el('h3','Prepared for'),el('p',field('client')),el('p',field('client-details'),'quote-multiline'));const dates=el('div');dates.append(el('p',`Issued: ${date}`));if(valid)dates.append(el('p',`Valid until: ${valid}`));meta.append(client,dates);preview.append(meta);
 const wrap=el('div','','quote-table-wrap'),table=el('table'),thead=el('thead'),tr=el('tr');wrap.tabIndex=0;wrap.setAttribute('role','region');wrap.setAttribute('aria-label','Quotation items; scroll horizontally to see all columns');['Description','Qty','Unit price','Amount'].forEach(text=>{const th=el('th',text);th.setAttribute('scope','col');tr.append(th);});thead.append(tr);table.append(thead);const tbody=el('tbody');rows.forEach((row,i)=>{const line=el('tr');[row.description,row.quantity,money(Math.round(Number(row.rate)*100)),money(result.lines[i])].forEach(text=>line.append(el('td',text)));tbody.append(line);});table.append(tbody);wrap.append(table);preview.append(wrap);
 const totals=el('dl','','quote-totals');[['Subtotal',result.subtotal],[`Discount (${field('discount')}%)`,-result.discount],[`Tax (${field('tax')}%)`,result.tax],['Total',result.total]].forEach(([label,amount])=>{const row=el('div');row.append(el('dt',String(label)),el('dd',money(Number(amount))));totals.append(row);});preview.append(totals);
 if(field('notes')){preview.append(el('h3','Notes & terms'),el('p',field('notes'),'quote-multiline'));}preview.append(el('p','Quotation only · Not a tax invoice','quote-doc-footer'));section.hidden=false;get('quote-status').textContent='Preview ready. Review all details before printing.';section.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'});
 }catch(e){get('quote-error').textContent=e instanceof Error?e.message:'Please check the quotation details.';}});
get('quote-print').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(!section.hidden)window.print();});
</script>
<style is:global>
.quote-meta-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}.kit-panel .short-area{min-height:90px}.quote-item{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,2fr) minmax(0,.7fr) minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:14px;align-items:end;padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.quote-item label{margin:0}.quote-item input{margin-top:8px}.quote-paper{background:#fff;color:#172b20;padding:44px;border-radius:12px;max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.quote-doc-head,.quote-doc-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px;margin-bottom:32px}.quote-doc-head>div,.quote-doc-meta>div{max-width:55%;min-width:0}.quote-doc-head h2{font-size:1.45rem;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin-bottom:8px}.quote-paper h3{font-size:.85rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;margin-bottom:8px}.quote-paper p{font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.7}.quote-doc-meta{padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #274c32}.quote-multiline{white-space:pre-wrap}.quote-table-wrap{overflow:auto;margin-bottom:24px}.quote-paper table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:.88rem}.quote-paper th{background:#edf2e9;text-align:left;padding:12px 10px;font-weight:650}.quote-paper td{padding:14px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #dbe1d8;vertical-align:top}.quote-paper th:not(:first-child),.quote-paper td:not(:first-child){text-align:right}.quote-paper td:first-child{min-width:130px;max-width:400px;white-space:pre-wrap}.quote-totals{width:330px;max-width:100%;margin:24px 0 36px auto}.quote-totals>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;padding:9px 0}.quote-totals dd{text-align:right}.quote-totals>div:last-child{border-top:2px solid #274c32;margin-top:8px;padding-top:14px;font-weight:750;font-size:1.2rem}.quote-doc-footer{margin-top:36px;padding-top:15px;border-top:1px solid #dbe1d8;color:#5b6a5e;font-size:.75rem!important}
@media(max-width:760px){.quote-meta-fields{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.quote-item{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.quote-item>div:first-child{grid-column:1/-1}.quote-remove{justify-self:start}.quote-paper{padding:22px}.quote-doc-head,.quote-doc-meta{flex-direction:column;gap:16px}.quote-doc-head>div,.quote-doc-meta>div{max-width:100%}}
@media screen and (max-width:760px){
 .quote-table-wrap{max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto}
 .quote-paper table{min-width:540px}
 .quote-paper th,.quote-paper td:not(:first-child){white-space:nowrap;overflow-wrap:normal}
 .quote-table-wrap:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #274c32;outline-offset:3px}
 .quote-paper::before{content:"Swipe the items table sideways to see all columns.";display:block;margin-bottom:20px;color:#5b6a5e;font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.5}
}
@media print{@page{size:A4;margin:15mm}body{background:#fff!important;color:#172b20!important}.site-header,body>footer,.skip-link,#main-content>.container>*:not(#quote-preview-section){display:none!important}#main-content>.container{width:100%!important;padding:0!important;margin:0!important}#quote-preview-section{display:block!important;margin:0!important}#quote-preview-section[hidden]{display:none!important}#quote-preview-section>*:not(#quote-preview){display:none!important}.quote-paper{padding:0!important;max-width:none;border-radius:0}.quote-table-wrap{overflow:visible}.quote-doc-head,.quote-doc-meta{flex-direction:row}.quote-doc-head>div,.quote-doc-meta>div{max-width:55%}.quote-paper table{table-layout:fixed;font-size:9pt}.quote-paper th:first-child{width:46%}.quote-paper th:nth-child(2){width:10%}.quote-paper th:nth-child(3),.quote-paper th:nth-child(4){width:22%}.quote-paper td:first-child{min-width:0}.quote-paper tr{break-inside:avoid}.quote-paper thead{display:table-header-group}.quote-totals{break-inside:avoid}.quote-paper{-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;print-color-adjust:exact}}
</style>
